==Strategy==
Since there are limited enemies before the boss spawns, it is possible to stall for money with slow Cats and then let them die and stall the last few enemies with nothing but [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Dual]] [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Walls]]. Once you have enough money, hit the base and fight JUPITER KING. He is fairly weak to tanky Cats like [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cat]] and [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cat]], but you'll have to clear his support before being able to hit him at all.

